# Project Licenses

This project is licensed under a dual open-source framework tailored for open-source hardware (OSHW) and software/tooling.

---

## 1. Hardware License (Schematics, PCB Layouts, Manufacturing Files, 3D CAD)

The hardware design files (including but not limited to EasyEDA schematics, PCB layout files, Gerber/drill production files, BOM, Pick-and-Place data, and 3D enclosure CAD models) are licensed under the **CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Permissive (CERN-OHL-P v2)**.

### CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Permissive

Copyright (c) 2026 OBD2 ESP32 Project Contributors

Preamble
CERN has developed this licence to promote collaboration on the hardware design of products, the sharing of technologies and to address specific issues of hardware licensing that are not addressed by conventional software licences. This licence governs the use, copying, modification and distribution of Hardware Designs, and the making and distribution of Products.

You may use, copy, modify, distribute, and manufacture products based on this hardware design under the terms and conditions of the CERN-OHL-P v2.

Full license text: https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_p_v2.txt

